OL,3,APope's South American trip to go ahead
OL,4,Aas planned after lung cancer surgery
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Vatican has confirmed that Pope Leo
OL,7,Fwill go on his South American tour as
OL,8,Fplanned, following his surgery for lung
OL,9,Fcancer.
OL,11,FHe was diagnosed with lung cancer and
OL,12,Funderwent successful surgery in Rome on
OL,13,F13 October to remove a tumour on the
OL,14,Flower part of his right lung.
OL,16,FThe 71-year-old is scheduled to travel
OL,17,Fto Uruguay, Argentina and Peru on 6-17
OL,18,FNovember, the Vatican said, adding that
OL,19,Fthe he was looking forward to it "with
OL,20,Fgreat joy and enthusiasm".
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
